            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "1. 数的概念是由于实践的需要逐步形成的。很早以前，",
              "人类就使用数来 а) 计数，б) 测量量的大小。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0052#5",
          "block_index_zero_based": 4,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/4",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "一个给定的有限集合包含有多少个元素？这样的问题的",
              "答案总是可以用一个自然数或者零（如果是空集）来表示。因",
              "此，包含一切非负整数的集合",
              "$Z_0=\\{0,1,2,3,\\ldots\\}$",
              "完全满足计数的需要。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0052#6",
          "block_index_zero_based": 5,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/5",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "测量量的大小时，情况就不一样了。两个村子之间的距",
              "离可能是 $3.5$ 公里，房间的面积也可能是 $16.45$ 平方米，等等。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0052#7",
          "block_index_zero_based": 6,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/6",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "利用除法运算，可将任何一个非负分数 $\\frac{m}{n}$（$m\\geqslant0,n>0$，",
              "都是整数）化为有限小数或者无穷小数：",
              "$\\frac{1}{8}=0.125,$",
              "$\\frac{11}{3}=3.6666666\\ldots.$"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0052#8",
          "block_index_zero_based": 7,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/7",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "为了一致起见，我们将在有限小数的右面补上无穷个零：",
              "$\\frac{1}{8}=0.12500000\\ldots.$"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0052#9",
          "block_index_zero_based": 8,
