            "lines": [
              "对于整数，也可以在小数点的右面补上无穷个零：",
              "$17=17.00000\\ldots.$"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0053#2",
          "block_index_zero_based": 1,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/1",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "这样一来，我们看到，任何非负有理数都可以用无穷小数的形",
              "式来表示：",
              "$r=a_0.a_1a_2a_3\\ldots.$"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0053#3",
          "block_index_zero_based": 2,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/2",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "这里的 $a_0$ 是 $r$ 的整数部分，而",
              "$0.a_1a_2a_3\\ldots$",
              "是它的小数部分。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0053#4",
          "block_index_zero_based": 3,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/3",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "2. 这种表示法，对于负有理数也适用。不过为了避免误",
              "解，必须在负数的整数部分上方画一横线（负号）。例如，将数",
              "$-\\frac{3}{2}=-2+\\frac{1}{2}$",
              "写成以下形式：",
              "$\\overline{2}.500000000\\ldots.$"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0053#5",
          "block_index_zero_based": 4,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/4",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "类似地，",
              "$-0.789=\\overline{1}.21100000\\ldots,$",
              "$-117\\frac{1}{3}=-117.3333\\ldots=-118+\\frac{2}{3}=\\overline{118}.66666\\ldots.$"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0053#6",
          "block_index_zero_based": 5,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/5",
          "n12_scope": true,
          "scope_note": "n12 source context; this is not a full-page glyph/science review.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "因此，任何有理数 $r$ 都可以表示为无穷小数：",
              "$r=a_0.a_1a_2a_3\\ldots,$",
              "其中的 $a_0$ 是整数，而整数 $a_k$（$k=1,2,3,\\ldots$）是满足不等式",
              "$0\\leqslant a_k<9$",
              "的整数。这时，$a_0$ 是数 $r$ 的整数部分，而数 $r$ 的小数部分是无",
              "穷小数：",
              "$0.a_1a_2a_3\\ldots.$"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
