            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "前一小节中我们看到的小数，有的自某一位开始所有的",
              "数字重复出现：$0.12500000\\ldots$，$3.6666666\\ldots$，等等。这样的小",
              "数叫做循环小数。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0055#4",
          "block_index_zero_based": 3,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/3",
          "n12_scope": false,
          "scope_note": "Read-only page snapshot; section 13/footer is not independently reviewed here.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "定义 对于无穷小数",
              "$a_0.a_1a_2a_3\\ldots,$",
              "如果存在这样的自然数 $N$ 和 $p$，使得",
              "$a_{n+p}=a_n,$ 对一切 $n\\geqslant N$，",
              "那么就把它叫做循环小数（无穷循环小数）。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0055#5",
          "block_index_zero_based": 4,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/4",
          "n12_scope": false,
          "scope_note": "Read-only page snapshot; section 13/footer is not independently reviewed here.",
          "block": {
            "kind": "p",
            "label": null,
            "box": null,
            "owner_exercise": null,
            "cont": false,
            "open": false,
            "samerow": false,
            "lines": [
              "例如，$3.6666666\\ldots$ 是循环小数：对于这个数，$N=1,p=1$，",
              "而且对于一切 $n\\geqslant1$ 有 $a_{n+1}=a_n=6$。数 $0.12500000\\ldots$ 也是无",
              "穷循环小数：这里 $N=4,p=1$，而且对于一切 $n\\geqslant4$ 有 $a_{n+1}↵=a_n=0$。数 $\\overline{2}.1783838383\\ldots$ 也是无穷循环小数：这里 $N=3$，",
              "$p=2$，而且对于一切 $n\\geqslant3$ 有 $a_{n+2}=a_n$。这是因为，对于奇数",
              "$n$，有 $a_n=8$，对于偶数 $n$，有 $a_n=3$。循环小数通常采用简",
              "写：$3.6666666\\ldots$ 写成 $3.(6)$，$0.1250000000\\ldots$ 写成 $0.125(0)$，",
              "$\\overline{2}.1783838383838383\\ldots$ 写成 $\\overline{2}.17(83)$。括号里的数叫做循环节：",
              "$3.(6)$ 读作三点循环六，$\\overline{2}.17(83)$ 读作二带负号点一七循环八",
              "三。* 现在我们证明一个重要定理。"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "source_ref": "p0055#6",
          "block_index_zero_based": 5,
          "json_pointer": "/blocks/5",
          "n12_scope": false,
          "scope_note": "Read-only page snapshot; section 13/footer is not independently reviewed here.",
